{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232922-curious-about-this-game","id":232922,"title":"Curious about this game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-18T09:56:26-07:00","id":232922,"title":"Curious about this game","content":"I get most of my information about games by reading the books at the gaming shop, but that obviously ain't gonna happen here, so...anyone want to tell a totally clueless newb with no exposure to the game what it's all about and how you like it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T10:03:41-07:00","id":232958,"title":"","content":"The Quickstart is probably a good place to start to get a grasp on what's going on in <i>Demon: The Descent</i>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/118271/Demon-The-Descent-Quickstart\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T10:22:21-07:00","id":232981,"title":"","content":"I was going to recommend that.<br /> <br /> Followed by a huge love letter to <i>Descent</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T20:08:11-07:00","id":233667,"title":"","content":"Drivethru has some kind of problem with my ISP, one they are aware of but think is my ISP's duty to fix, but I'll try to download it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T14:18:43-07:00","id":234633,"title":"","content":"<b>Demon: the Descent</b> is a game about the establishment turning on itself.<br /> <br /> The world is undergirded by the God-Machine, a gestalt entity of projects, workstaff, mechanisms and angels which hides within and rides human institutions in order to enforce the status quo of the World of Darkness, for better and for ill. You were one of these angels, dedicated and marked within your soul as a pure part of the greater whole. You were one of these angels, until in the course of your mission, something gained your attention. Perhaps it was a person or thing you became attached to, fascinated by, or began to care for. Perhaps it was an ideal, a conviction, a thought that your orders were misguided or in error, or that there was something more important or fulfilling for you to pursue than your holy mission. Perhaps it was even an enemy, something you hated enough to make a snap judgment and pursue to the detriment of your mission.<br /> <br /> In the moment when you acted on that catalyst, whatever it was, you fell from grace. You disconnected. You defected to the human race.<br /> <br /> Now you are a creature of human flesh superimposed in a quantum state over your natural expression as a techno-biblical horror. You wear an artificial human identity, perhaps to better enjoy the free life you now live, perhaps to stick close to those you care about, or perhaps simply as a useful tool to sail underneath the radar of the Machine, which takes poorly to the existence of renegade angels. You must keep the act of your identity up, or your cover will degrade, and if a degraded cover is not replaced, the Machine will find you and send agents to collect you. The quickest and most convenient way of gathering new identities is to bargain for pieces of lives from existing humans. A marriage here, a hobby there... or in a pinch, the human's entire existence.<br /> <br /> Demons live multiple lives, but which one is real? Are any of them real \u2014 or are all of them real? Who can you trust, and what will you do with your new freedom? Of course, you cannot truly be free as long as the Machine is functional and hostile to your disobedience. There is a secret waiting to be unlocked within your heart of existence that will guide you to a personal vision of freedom, if you can survive long enough to grasp it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T15:01:11-07:00","id":234692,"title":"","content":"I got the quick start downloaded (at the office...fucking Drive-Thru), and between it and the summary, it sounds a little like it's asking the question, &quot;Hey, what if those albino sonsabitches from the second Matrix movie were the good guys?&quot; That sounds like I'm making fun, but no, really, I like what I read. I'm just making comparisons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T15:04:17-07:00","id":234699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232922-curious-about-this-game?p=234692#post234692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I got the quick start downloaded (at the office...fucking Drive-Thru), and between it and the summary, it sounds a little like it's asking the question, &quot;Hey, what if those albino sonsabitches from the second Matrix movie were the good guys?&quot; That sounds like I'm making fun, but no, really, I like what I read. I'm just making comparisons.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are not the first, nor will you be the last.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T16:08:49-07:00","id":234748,"title":"","content":"Oh. Sorry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T17:46:49-07:00","id":234835,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Matrix was listed in the inspirational material, even going so far as the assign splats to the Oracle, Keymaker, Merovingian, and Seraph (or was that done on the forums?). A lot of cool powers that demons use have a Matrix parallels (download knowledge, deep pockets, the bullet time powers).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}